  m_Name: 1850 peranakan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: 'Peranakan Community Emerges 19th Century '
  info: "The Peranakan, or Straits Chinese, community emerged from the intermarriage
    of Chinese immigrants and local Malays. They created a rich cultural blend evident
    in their distinctive attire, such as the kebaya, and unique dishes like laksa
    and ayam buah keluak. The Peranakan legacy is celebrated as a vibrant part of
    Singapore\u2019s multicultural heritage.  "
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afe917992a9df41c1aba78e5e0f08221, type: 3}
